WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.040
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.750
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.380
We've lost contact! Chirico's status: unknown!

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.710
He may already have reached Wiseman!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.670
Making a deal with Wiseman will be impossible!

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.580
The only option left is to destroy everything!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.250
Quent must be annihilated!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.420
Shooting Star

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.250
Chirico, come out of here with me!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.040
Stay out of this.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:15.670
No!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.630
Do you really want Wiseman's power that badly?

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.380
It's meaningless!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.630
What would you do with power like that?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.170
One step further and I'll shoot.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.500
I'll kill you and then I'll kill myself!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.830
Chirico!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.000
Chirico!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.630
Well done, Chirico.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:10.330
I now see how hardened your will
has become, my successor.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.460
I want your power!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.500
Then come forward.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.170
Climb, Chirico!

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.540
Come...

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:19.960
Quickly!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.330
Climb!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:21.790
Come, Chirico. It's just a little further.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:27.040
I can't do it... Show yourself to me.

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.380
This is me.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.880
No! I mean the real you!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.790
It's all the same.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:37.750
My physical body has long since rotted away.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.210
Then you don't really exist?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.710
You called me here to show me
this mechanical sleight-of-hand?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.580
Our physical forms are gone.
But our consciousness...

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.710
My consciousness still exists, perfectly.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.880
Then you're just a memory bank?

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.540
No. I live.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:17.420
Even now, I am watching you.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.000
Now, climb.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.710
I can do no more to help you.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:32.920
Stand, Chirico!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:33.630
I can't.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:38.170
Don't you want my power?
After you've come this far?

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.750
You are like me. An Overman.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:45.330
You made the entire world your enemy
and came here to be my heir.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:48.580
The power you wish me to grant you is near.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:53.040
But I can't even reach out my hand to take it!

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:56.710
You are already inside of me.

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.000
With this plasma preservation system,

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:04.960
the knowledge and power I've held for
3,000 years will be given to you in an instant.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.420
It's no use. I can't move.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.460
Are you really this weak?
You complain at this point?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.790
All you need do now is stand up!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.330
All you need do is reach out your hand, Chirico!

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.380
I can't...

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.420
Stand, Chirico!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:25.290
Just do that, and you will become my successor.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:26.540
Stand!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.750
Chirico! What have you done?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.420
The transmission system!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.920
I don't believe it!

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.000
Don't be a fool, Chirico!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.330
Don't you want my power?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.420
Do you not fear me?

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:50.380
Don't think you can oppose me, Chirico!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.540
Why?

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.080
Stop this foolishness, Chirico!

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:05.420
Stop it, Chirico!

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:09.250
If you do not obey me, I will kill you!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.580
Go ahead and try!

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.880
I'm inside your own brain!

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:16.080
No matter what kind of defense systems you have,

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.000
I don't think you'd dare use them in here!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:22.960
You still don't understand my true power.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.630
Then go ahead and try!

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.380
I'm prepared to die with you!

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:29.170
Stop it, Chirico!

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.040
Stop it!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.210
Chirico!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:40.210
As you wandered the battlefield, risking your life,

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:44.130
my interventions saved you over and over!

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:45.960
From the depths of your conscious mind.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.460
Fyana is one example.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:52.540
It was I who ordained your meeting her!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.330
You're lying!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.500
Then how did you know her name?

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:01.750
For the first time you, who had no hope
were given a reason to go on living.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:06.330
Along with your love grew the desire
for strength and power!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:10.670
Before all else, I made you an ordinary man!

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:11.460
You lie!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.670
No, you've changed more than you realize.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:19.630
Your lust for power has grown
even stronger than your love!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.460
And now you try to kill even me!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:26.290
It is not beyond reason.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:29.500
It is why you shot Fyana!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.330
Think back over all that has happened!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:37.210
The sins you've committed
will torture you for all eternity!

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:40.710
Chirico, you need not consider them sins!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:42.830
You should instead take pride in them!

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.630
Become my heir and take control of all war!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:51.460
In absolute power you will find absolution!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:56.380
Chirico, only God does not sin when He kills.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.630
Only God!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.580
Stop it!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.380
Stop this, Chirico!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.040
Stop it now!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:09.290
This is what I have dreamed of for so long!

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:12.080
A dream which began 3,000 years ago!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.750
Even beyond my limited control,
I believed that, far in the future,

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:19.000
I would one day surpass human intellect
and achieve divinity!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:23.880
That I would achieve
the absolute and the eternal!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:31.250
But, to my... sorrow, I will not gain... this.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:39.080
This... imperfect succession will...
not produce... a... god.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:47.750
I... will not... see... another...
gen-er-a-tion... to... follow.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:53.420
My... mem-or-ies... are... al-rea-dy... be-ing...

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.420
Stop... this... Chi-ri-co.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:04.380
You... do... not... un-der-stand...
what... you... are... do-ing.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:08.080
Stop... this... mad-ness.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:12.130
If... this... power... is... des-troyed...

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:17.040
it... can... ne-ver... be... res-tored.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.580
I... am... the... light... of... this... world...

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:22.580
I... am... the... goal... of... in... tell... ect...

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:29.250
Stop... this... Chi... ri... co...

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:36.290
Stop... this... Chi... ri... co!

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:42.210
Stop... this... Chi...

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:51.380
Sto-o-op... this... Chi-i-i... ri-i... co...

00:14:51.380 --> 00:15:00.830
Sto-o-op... thi-i-is... Chi-i-i... ri-i... c-co...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:09.290
Stop... this... Chi... ri... co...

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:15.750
Ch... ri... co... Stop... this...

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.750
Chirico!
Ch... ri... co... Stop... this...

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:18.420
Chirico!

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:24.210
Chirico! What have you done?

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:27.670
If I'd gotten here any later,
we couldn't reactivate him!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.500
Come on, put them back in!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.830
There's still time!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.830
Put them all back, Chirico!

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.290
Chirico, wait!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.210
Fyana!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.790
Keep going! I'll help you!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:52.790
Forgive me! I had to keep Wiseman fooled
up to the very end.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:56.540
I realized that when you didn't shoot to kill.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.670
Come on!

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:07.210
Stop... Chi... ri... co...

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:15.460
Stop... Chi... ri... co...

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:24.920
Af-f-fraid... stop...

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:33.920
Af-f-f-raid-d-d... I'm... af... fraid...

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:37.540
I'm... af-ff-frai-d-

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.670
Stop it! That's enough!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.920
He's dead!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.540
You did it. You actually did it!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.330
My God! How could you be so blind?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.670
Why didn't you accept the throne of power
he'd prepared for you?

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:58.000
You've just killed God!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.040
All missiles, prepare for launch!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:27.330
You gave up the title you'd earned
and chose the path of obscurity out of fear!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:30.210
The burden of power was too much for you!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.040
You were afraid!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.040
The power I so desired...

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.750
And you killed him!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:41.040
If only... If only I were an Overman!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.040
If I...!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:44.420
If I were an Overman!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.920
All missiles, standing by!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.000
Very well! Begin countdown!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.750
Ten!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.500
Nine!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.210
Eight!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.210
Seven!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.040
Six!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:54.880
Five!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:55.420
Four!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.790
Shockwave detected!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.540
Planet Quent's just exploded!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.250
That's impossible!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.960
The blast wave will reach us in eight seconds!

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.290
One second!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:48.210
One year later

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:48.210
Astragius Year 7215

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.960
As a result of the fighting which occurred

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.040
in the Nonaggression Zone a few days ago,

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.080
Gilgamesh and its allies have resolved

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.920
that this cannot go unanswered!

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:55.290
We have determined that this
act of aggression by the Balarant

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:58.710
constitutes a de facto declaration of war!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:04.290
As of this day, any Balarant vessel found
inside of Gilgamesh or allied territory

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:07.170
will be fired upon without warning!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.630
Enemy mobile forces sighted!

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.290
All personnel to battle stations!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.080
All personnel to battle stations!

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.210
Hey! What are you doing?
All personnel to battle stations!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:14.960
Hey! What are you doing?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.330
Are you deserting your posts?

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.830
Why are you loading that thing onboard?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:20.960
Hurry up and-

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.330
Who the hell are you?!

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.750
All right, it worked.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.290
Just sit tight, you two.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:47.420
What are you doing?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.880
Shako! Come on!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.460
What the...?

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:02.580
What's going on?

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.830
So, how's it feel to be on
an express ride to the frontier?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.290
Fantastic!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.380
A little rough, though.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.790
I'll get rich on all the
arms trading this war'll bring.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.500
Maybe I'll build a little repair shop
somewhere out in the country.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.130
You're getting old, Pops.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.500
And what are your plans?

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.670
What are our plans?

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.040
You know what I'm planning, don't you?

00:20:58.420 --> 00:20:59.540
Silly boy!

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.540
It's time.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:01.880
Let's do it.

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:05.580
Come on, Chirico. Won't you reconsider this?

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.040
Wiseman's gone.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:10.460
God's dead, but war started anyway.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.500
But...

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.130
As long as war exists, they'll try to use us.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.210
We weren't meant to live in this time.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.170
Do you really think it exists?
A world without war?

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:23.790
I do.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:27.000
I'll never forget you guys.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.130
I hope they'll be happy.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:56.960
Those two'll be just fine.

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.630
We'll be asleep in twenty minutes.

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:20.790
I'd like to look at the stars until then. Open it.

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:36.290
Coconna...

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.420
Gotho...

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:38.880
Vanilla...

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:40.500
Shako...

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:43.380
I'm glad I was able to meet you all.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.080
And you, Fyana...

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:54.250
The End

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.960
Samishii toki mo

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:19.500
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.920
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:33.330
Aitai toki mo

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:39.580
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:23:39.580 --> 00:23:43.080
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:46.500
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:53.000
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:59.330
Ano hi no anata ga...
